{"parse":{"title":"With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins","pageid":458466,"revid":2126773,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/6/6b/Constellation_With_a_Vow_to_Rescue%2C_the_Journey_Begins.png/revision/latest?cb=20260525041937\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/6/6b/Constellation_With_a_Vow_to_Rescue%2C_the_Journey_Begins.png/revision/latest?cb=20260525041937\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/6/6b/Constellation_With_a_Vow_to_Rescue%2C_the_Journey_Begins.png/revision/latest?cb=20260525041937 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/6/6b/Constellation_With_a_Vow_to_Rescue%2C_the_Journey_Begins.png/revision/latest?cb=20260525041937 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_With_a_Vow_to_Rescue%2C_the_Journey_Begins.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prune\" title=\"Prune\">Prune</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Useful_for_Cleaning_Messy_Baggage,_Elemental_Powers_Are_Indeed\" title=\"Useful for Cleaning Messy Baggage, Elemental Powers Are Indeed\">Useful for Cleaning Messy Baggage, Elemental Powers Are Indeed</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">After the <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Banehunter Oathhammer</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Banehunter Oathhammer</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">A witchhunter's trusty companion! Under the right conditions, the Banehunter Oathhammer undergoes Elemental Conversion, turning all its DMG into DMG of the corresponding Elemental Type.<br />Prune can summon the Banehunter Oathhammer that has undergone Elemental Conversion in the following ways:<br /><ul><li> For a certain time after triggering a Swirl Reaction on an opponent with the Elemental Skill Ring-A-Ding-Ding! Hexhunter Chime, Prune can unleash the special Elemental Skill Clang Clang! Witch-tribution Comes!. When using this special Elemental Skill, the Banehunter Oathhammer will be converted to the other Elemental Type involved in the aforementioned Swirl Reaction.</li><li> After the Ascension Talent \"Verdict and Punishment\" is unlocked, when the Witchlure Bell in Hunter-Seeker mode triggers Swirl on an opponent, it will summon a Banehunter Oathhammer that has undergone the corresponding Elemental Conversion to attack the opponent.</li></ul></span></span></span> that has undergone Elemental <a href=\"/wiki/Conversion\" title=\"Conversion\">Conversion</a> hits an opponent, Prune will regain 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a>. This effect can occur once every 1.8s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Energy Generation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Prune\" title=\"Prune\">Prune</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_1_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 1 Constellation\">Level 1 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWith_a_Vow_to_Rescue%2C_the_Journey_Begins%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">立下寻救的誓言，旅途由此开端</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">立下尋救的誓言，旅途由此開端</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">誓いを立てたあの日から</span> <span lang=\"ja\">キミを救う旅が始まった</span><br /><small><i>Chikai wo Tateta Ano Hi Kara Kimi wo Sukuu Tabi ga Hajimatta</i></small></td><td>Since the Day of Making the Vow, the Journey to Save You Has Started</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">시작된</span> <span lang=\"ko\">구출의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">여정</span><br /><small><i>Sijakdoen Guchurui Yeojeong</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Con una promesa de rescate, el viaje comienza</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Avec la promesse de chercher le salut, le voyage commence</td><td>With the Promise to Seek Salvation, the Journey Begins</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">С</span> <span lang=\"ru\">клятвы</span> <span lang=\"ru\">найти</span> <span lang=\"ru\">спасение</span> <span lang=\"ru\">странствие</span> <span lang=\"ru\">начинается</span><br /><small><i>S klyatvy nayti spaseniye stranstviye nachinayetsya</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Lời Thề Giải Cứu, Hành Trình Bắt Đầu Từ Đây</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Mit dem Rettungsschwur begann die Reise</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>With a Vow to Rescue, the Journey Begins</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>A Jornada Inicia no Juramento do Resgate</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Kurtulu<span lang=\"tr\">ş</span>a Ant <span lang=\"tr\">İç</span>tin, Ba<span lang=\"tr\">ş</span>lad<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span> Yolculu<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>un</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Con un giuramento di soccorso, il viaggio ha inizio</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3